quidad se volverá sobre su cabeza, y su agravio descenderá sobre su mollera.", "words": [[0, 109151], [3, 109354], [13, 110274], [16, 110534], [24, 111074], [30, 111354], [33, 111594], [41, 112014], [43, 112274], [46, 112474], [54, 113134], [65, 114034], [71, 114334], [74, 114805]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 115654, "end": 121947, "text": "Alabaré yo a Jehová conforme a su justicia, y cantaré al nombre de Jehová el Altísimo.", "words": [[0, 115887], [8, 116161], [11, 116434], [13, 116594], [20, 117054], [29, 117384], [31, 117714], [34, 117854], [44, 118634], [46, 119134], [54, 119694], [57, 119894], [64, 120234], [67, 120434], [74, 120934], [77, 121034]]}]}